    "explanation": "Cho'gall's nature makes him particularly vulnerable to most forms of crowd control, strong single-target damage, and percent-based damage sources. Fortunately, Cho'gall has plenty of Talent choices and maneuvers that allow him to adapt to a variety of less-than-ideal situations. However, Anub'arak's Cocoon or Maiev's Containment Disc can turn the fight into a 5v3, and are a major threat to Cho'gall."
